1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,390
Make a duck with your hand.

2
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:02,384
Knuckles bent,

3
00:00:02,384 --> 00:00:03,350
fingers straight.

4
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:04,833
Now spread them.

5
00:00:04,884 --> 00:00:05,600
Stuck?

6
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:06,286
Your knuckles

7
00:00:06,286 --> 00:00:07,800
just buckled them in.

8
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:10,210
Each knuckle has two side straps.

9
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:10,774
Bend it,

10
00:00:10,774 --> 00:00:11,982
and a bump in the bone

11
00:00:11,982 --> 00:00:13,300
pulls them tight.

12
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,840
Now flatten your hand.

13
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,293
Slack straps...

14
00:00:16,293 --> 00:00:17,700
and they spread!

15
00:00:17,750 --> 00:00:19,993
Doctors often splint broken hands

16
00:00:19,993 --> 00:00:21,240
in duck mode,

17
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:23,700
so those straps can't shrink.

18
00:00:23,746 --> 00:00:25,040
Now duck again.

19
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,130
Buckled.

